# Testing Development (caveman)

- Every change needs automated test proof.
- Use Pest as default.
- Prefer feature tests; add unit tests where useful.
- Keep tests isolated and deterministic.
- Test happy path + failure path + edge path.
- Run minimum relevant tests fast (`php artisan test --compact` + filter/file).

- Use factories/states for setup.
- Module tests stay inside module `tests/`.
- Tooling details in `laravel-boost.mdc`.
